# AptiPass English's own GA4 Measurement ID (separate property from
# aptipass.com). Not a secret — a GA4 Measurement ID is inherently public,
# visible in every page's HTML source to any visitor. Committed here so
# `next build` picks it up automatically without a manual env var step.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-0EQ9L0P5NN
